  "details": {
   "biography": {
    "value": "<p>Radiant dragons dwell on the terraced slopes of Mount Celestia, guardians of law and goodness. They judge carefully and act decisively, and their counsel is sought by archons and mortals alike. Light pours from their mirrored scales.</p><p><em>Unofficial 5e conversion of a dragon from an earlier edition of the game, for the Legacy Dragons module.</em></p>",
